WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.300
Cooking this year?

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:04.520
Here is a full ThanksLiving table you can make at home:

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:07.200
a savory loaf, gravy, mashed potatoes, stuffing,

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:10.560
cranberry sauce, green beans and pumpkin pie.
